%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: ShorMoment
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: A fox?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Is that not appropriate for the: "trickster god?"'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: Would you have preferred the vengeful paladin who's poured oceans of
      blood?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118403630956545
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: Maybe you'd prefer my most visible form; my sundered body in the night
      sky.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118403630956546
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Or perhaps you''d rather see my most vile incarnation: the demon who
      tricked the spirits to be both limits and the limited.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118403630956548
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Th-the fox is fine...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, were the others too intimidating?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: Very well.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118403630956549
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Figures that an Aedra can read my mind...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: Read your mind?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: Is that what you would call it?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm... a bit surprised that someone from outside of the dream is so...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: Beholden to it.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: If even some from within the dream can see it for what it is, surely
      one from without could do so, even more so.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, I do <i>know</i> that everything in the Aurbis is just the result
      of the Godhead's dream...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: But I can't really do anything with that knowledge, unlike Vivec or the
      mess that is Tiber-Talos-Zurin-Wulfharth Septim.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: Hm.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: I am a bit disappointed, that other intruder seemed to imply you had
      similar status to them.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: Maybe I just misunderstood what they said.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, did you not know you weren't alone?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well I knew that, I came with four other people here.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: But who was this... intruder that spoke with you?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 'Or, I suppose a more helpful question on my end- '
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: What color was her hair?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: Her hair?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: They were as formless as I was, so I doubt that question would do you
      much good.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118406542327810
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ?!?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Did they say their-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: Name? No.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118406542327811
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: Again, I go by many names, so knowing a specific name wouldn't do you
      much good either, I assume.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118406542327808
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118406542327809
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, what did they talk to you about?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: They spoke to me about the Aurbis and where they needed it to bend.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: '... What? Why-? '
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: Why did they need to know about that?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: I don't really know; I didn't feel the need to ask.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Some stranger barges into your... realm? Domain? Lair-?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Asks you about how to manipulate the very cosmos you helped arrange-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: And you don't even bother to ask why?!?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, of course not.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: Because the means by which they are trying to find their end-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: They interest me.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118406542327864
    - rid: 1790118406542327866
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: And that was the whole point, wasn't it?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118406542327865
    - rid: 1790118406542327867
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: For one was made to satisfy the other...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So they needed to change something, what did they need to change?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: It was very simple, really.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118406542327868
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: They wanted to know about the manipulation, domination, and various aspects
      of the soul.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... simple. <i>Riiiiight</i>...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Like what?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: They were interested in creating an interface that would allow a being
      even higher than them to interact through other beings-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: Which was interesting, because they wanted this device to be able to
      only override the other beings when the higher being prompts it.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: I am a bit intrigued as to why this higher being wouldn't prefer complete
      and total control over an avatar-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: But I suppose that would be a bit hypocritical coming from me.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118406542327869
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So did you figure out this... interface?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: That's a very amusing question.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118406542327870
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... why...?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, don't worry. I'll show you.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118406542327871
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Huh?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118406542327872
    - rid: 1790118406542327873
    - rid: 1790118406542327874
    - rid: 4972360475574796486
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... is... is that...?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118406542327876
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: Indeed. I think we did rather well in making it.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118406542327877
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: Not only does it provide complete and total domination when prompted-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: But it also holds no exclusivity, it can make an avatar out of any present
      host.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: Nor is it particularly beholden to the dragon's "infalliable" line; time
      and space are no obstacle to it.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
